            "review_title": "Review at Lousiane Brewhouse Beer & Restaurant - Vinpearl Harbour",
            "review_text": "Ярослав\nSamara, Russia30 contributions\n0\nGreat beer restaurant.\nDec 2025 • Family\nThey were interested in different flavors of beer, ordered the whole shot at once to taste. Turns out the best beer is classic. \nCaesar salad tasted very strange - it was delicious, but prepared according to a very peculiar recipe.\nI recommend the restaurant for a large selection of foam and chic looks!\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten December 14, 2025",
