            "review_title": "Review at Lousiane Brewhouse Beer & Restaurant - Vinpearl Harbour",
            "review_text": "zalex1965\nZelenograd, Russia7007 contributions\n0\nVery decent beer!\nSep 2025 • Couples\nCame in here wandering the streets of Winpearl Harbor. Given the strength of can beer in Vietnam (a very controversial, sometimes, quality in my opinion) were surprised by the very fact of having this place.\nEven more surprised by the quality of the beer. After trying three varieties (light lager, wheat and red) came to the conclusion that it is worth going here again, and more than once. \nAnd, I don't know what was to blame, whether it was in the mood, or whether the beer was really good, but somehow even an appetizer was not required...\nAnyway, if you're on the island of Che, come in, it's worth it!\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten September 22, 2025",
            "rating": 4.0,
